=== Generated Answer (model draft; check against evidence) ===
Yes. The method treats a table as a triple consisting of headers, cells, and caption, where each header indicates the property of a column and can be used to identify a column [6]. Their approach matches the query against each aspect of the table, using different mechanisms to measure relevance between the query and headers, cells, and caption [8]. Caption is reported as the most effective single aspect on their dataset, which refers only to single-aspect performance, not to whether headers are used overall [9].
